# dev/ study outputs. Results CSVs are TRACKED: they are the evidence the
# manuscript and vignettes cite, and regenerating them costs hours of
# compute, so the private repo is their backup. (.Rbuildignore drops all of
# dev/ from the package tarball, so tracking them costs users nothing.)
# Timestamped .bak copies and run logs stay untracked, except the
# calibration/pilot logs kept alongside the results they produced.
dev/*.csv.bak-*
*.log
!/calib*.log
!/ess_pilot.log
